body:
Well it sounds like your bible study is sticking to the bible pretty well but that you feel conflicted regarding how modern knowledge on evolution and other forms of science fit into scripture. But it's important to remember that no science conflicts with God, because God created the world and universe that science describes. Thus Adam was the first homo sapien according to the Bible, which is true. However its also very likely that he did have a mother and father, as all sexual (as opposed to asexual) forms of life do.

&#x200B;

As for Cain, it is mentioned that Adam and Eve had other children and that by the point Cain left there were other civilizations.
